WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.779 --> 00:00:10.769
The people of Colombia who voted against the
agreement with the Revolutionary Armed Forces

00:00:10.769 --> 00:00:16.599
of Colombia, known by the Spanish initials
FARC, aren't rejecting peace and favoring

00:00:16.599 --> 00:00:17.599
war.

00:00:17.599 --> 00:00:23.140
The government of Juan Manuel Santos negotiated
with the terrorists for four years in Cuba

00:00:23.140 --> 00:00:26.970
and came up with a series of agreements where
they would lay down their arms, they would

00:00:26.970 --> 00:00:28.970
be gradually reintegrated into society.

00:00:28.970 --> 00:00:32.899
The Colombian people considered the details
of the plan.

00:00:32.899 --> 00:00:38.910
The fact that the guerillas would submit themselves
to some sort of ad hoc tribunals rather than

00:00:38.910 --> 00:00:40.960
the normal judicial system.

00:00:40.960 --> 00:00:46.039
They would be accorded seats almost immediately
in the Colombian Congress.

00:00:46.039 --> 00:00:49.870
And so, you had people who were considering
all of the damage done.

00:00:49.870 --> 00:00:54.260
The murders, the killing, the mayhem meted
out by the FARC.

00:00:54.260 --> 00:00:58.100
And now, these people are going to find their
way into the congress instead of going to

00:00:58.100 --> 00:00:59.100
jail.

00:00:59.100 --> 00:01:02.469
So now, we go back to the drawing board and
to negotiate new terms by which the guerillas

00:01:02.469 --> 00:01:06.680
will lay down their arms and be reintegrated
in Colombian society.

00:01:06.680 --> 00:01:10.760
Do you think Colombians made the right call
in rejecting this peace deal?

00:01:10.760 --> 00:01:15.140
Let us know in the comments section, and let
us know what other topics you want AEI scholars

00:01:15.140 --> 00:01:16.679
to cover in 60 seconds.

